  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cdb3c4aad0fcb53cee0c5445d7a2dad8e20bb230_0.webp\" alt=\"Jaden's Nether Expansion\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fThatJadenXgamer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/41e8a5f48e8d948883dd1ccff292ab19d9f292d2.png\" alt=\"Twitter / X\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/y9zpxHeQuC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c903b0317e14abb041077f10cec1e3c9813ed91.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fJaden-s-Nether-Expansion-5e297f08f3514b8287ebffb527f318a4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cbc419c446866c89930d3d292cad7b6fd9284ff1.png\" alt=\"JNE 維基\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jadens-nether-expansion/files/6729020\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a9a7c91d8999f2f0addb167f97be4480d44dba8d.png\" alt=\"下載適用於 Forge 的 JNE\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"換行\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2475e1dc950bd380a4814c3e8ebc3fcc45a6a61.png\" alt=\"關於\"></p>\n<p><strong>Jaden's Nether Expansion</strong> 是一款對原版友好的模組，旨在擴充整個地獄維度，新增各種內容並重構現有的原版概念。此專案持續成長並不斷更新，請準備好迎接史上最強大的地獄模組。</p>\n<p>它最初只是一個簡單的材質包，但如今已發展為適用於 Forge 1.20.1+ 的完整模組。</p>\n<p>如有任何問題，歡迎加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/y9zpxHeQuC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a></p>\n<p><strong>或瀏覽 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fJaden-s-Nether-Expansion-5e297f08f3514b8287ebffb527f318a4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a> 以獲取該模組的完整文件說明</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fJaden-s-Nether-Expansion-5e297f08f3514b8287ebffb527f318a4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1111833/description_a992a26a-ea57-429e-8c1b-226778aaab4e.png\" alt=\"維基\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"換行\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a611311d689ba4a3725c28f29575553b27d86a7c.png\" alt=\"相依模組\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elysium-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1111833/description_cd557a59-af44-44ba-91d7-6ee66c8cdc2d.png\" alt=\"Elysium API\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"換行\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/603cf9280a9882bd623ee6608592e6ca439568b1.png\" alt=\"開發路線圖\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/79497d3bc91aaf3ca5dbf7fe44b830c7dcb23890_0.webp\" alt=\"JNE 路線圖\"></p>\n<p>Jaden's Nether Expansion 正在持續更新，目前僅完成了整體計畫的八分之一！我將更新所有 5 個原版生物群系，並新增 4 個全新生物群系。</p>\n<p>每個群系都將擁有獨特的方塊、物品、生物、遊戲機制等更多內容！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"換行\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/11590b90cdf1650895af7e600a040cf17b2198ac.png\" alt=\"鳴謝\"></p>\n<h3>貢獻者：</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fBon_Exists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ceasingbonsai17</a> - 貢獻了螢光菇、光孢子以及多個模組相容材質</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCH2eK7HVNIQZpDlGS9Ton3g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alganaut</a> - 製作了黑色遊蕩者材質</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fludocrypt.bandcamp.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LudoCrypt</a> - 譜寫了蟋蟀音樂唱片</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Faithful</a> - 像素一致的熔岩立方體材質取自 Faithful 32x 與 64x</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Wawwior/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wawwior</a> - 協助修復了一些錯誤與問題</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fSydokiddo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sydokiddo</a> - 建議了「靈魂板岩」這個名稱</p>\n<h3>翻譯者：</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjuliusportfolio.carrd.co%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Julius</a> - 巴西葡萄牙語 [pt_br]</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/0Starocean0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">0Starocean0</a> - 簡體中文 [zh_cn]</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252foctagintaa%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">octaginta</a> - 土耳其語 [tr_tr]</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@sir_color\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SirColor</a> - 西班牙語 [es_es]</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Wawwior/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wawwior</a> & ThatJadenXgamer - 德語 [de_de]</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/AlexeyR2D2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AlexeyR2D2</a> & Linor - 俄語 [ru_ru]</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/AleXandr22/favorites\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sandro</a> - 義大利語 [it_it]</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/unroman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">unroman</a> - 烏克蘭語 [uk_ua]</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Tamakii-2005\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EtherealTams</a> - 阿根廷西班牙語 [es_ar]</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/TheDarkWatchernether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TheDarkWatcher</a> - 波蘭語 [pl_pl]</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/sunbatheproductions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">sunbatheproductions</a> - 日文 [jp_jp]</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"換行\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3f5988a82c3d6604b6b28d775158ccbdce9150a2.png\" alt=\"替換為描述文字\"></p>\n<p><strong>問：Jaden's Nether Expansion 是否仍為資料包／資源包？</strong></p>\n<p>答：不是。JNE 已完全重做，成為專為 Forge/NeoForge 設計的正式模組。</p>\n<p><strong>問：何時會更新到 X Minecraft 版本？</strong></p>\n<p>答：最終會更新，但目前暫無具體時間表。</p>\n<p><strong>問：會向下移植到其他版本嗎？</strong></p>\n<p>答：不會。</p>\n<p><strong>問：為何放棄了 Fabric 移植版？</strong></p>\n<p>答：同時在兩種模組載入器上維護像 JNE 這樣龐大的專案變得過於吃力。此外，Fabric API 本身功能較弱，嚴重限制了此模組的發展。未來 JNE 將專屬於 Forge/NeoForge。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"換行\"></p>",
